{"id":"9eea2b91ada30292","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-topo11-kolmogorov-quotient.md","title":"Kolmogorov Quotient","display":"df-zfc-topo11-kolmogorov-quotient — Kolmogorov Quotient","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo11-kolmogorov-quotient","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo11-kolmogorov-quotient"],"display":"df-zfc-topo11-kolmogorov-quotient — Kolmogorov Quotient","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo11-kolmogorov-quotient"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo11-kolmogorov-quotient</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo11-kolmogorov-quotient — Kolmogorov Quotient"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-zfc-topo11-kolmogorov-quotient-—-ZFC-Topo11-Kolmogorov-Quotient\">df-zfc-topo11-kolmogorov-quotient — ZFC Topo11 Kolmogorov Quotient</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span> (topological space), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> (topological-indistinguishability relation), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>（商载体候选）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:X\\to Q\">\\(q:X\\to Q\\)</span> (quotient map) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_Q\">\\(\\tau_Q\\)</span> (quotient topology)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (upstream predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11KolmogorovQuotient}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11KolmogorovQuotient}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}kolmogorov\\text{-}quotient}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11KolmogorovQuotient}_S(Q,\\tau_Q,q,X,\\tau,E)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land E\\subseteq X\\times X\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\Bigl(\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\n(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\leftrightarrow y\\in U))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land Q=\\{C\\in\\mathcal P(X):\\exists x\\in X\\;C=\\{y\\in X:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(q,X,Q)\n\\land\\Bigl(\\forall x\\in X\\;q(x)=\\{y\\in X:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\tau_Q=\\{O\\subseteq Q:q^{-1}[O]\\in\\tau\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}kolmogorov\\text{-}quotient}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11KolmogorovQuotient}_S(Q,\\tau_Q,q,X,\\tau,E)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land E\\subseteq X\\times X\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\Bigl(\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\n(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\leftrightarrow y\\in U))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land Q=\\{C\\in\\mathcal P(X):\\exists x\\in X\\;C=\\{y\\in X:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(q,X,Q)\n\\land\\Bigl(\\forall x\\in X\\;q(x)=\\{y\\in X:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\tau_Q=\\{O\\subseteq Q:q^{-1}[O]\\in\\tau\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The relation identifies exactly the topologically indistinguishable points; the quotient topology makes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> a quotient map and the resulting space is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_0\">\\(T_0\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-zfc-topo11-kolmogorov-quotient-—-ZFC-Topo11-Kolmogorov-Quotient","text":"df-zfc-topo11-kolmogorov-quotient — ZFC Topo11 Kolmogorov Quotient","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"q:X\\to Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S,\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11KolmogorovQuotient}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo11\\text{-}kolmogorov\\text{-}quotient}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo11KolmogorovQuotient}_S(Q,\\tau_Q,q,X,\\tau,E)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land E\\subseteq X\\times X\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\Bigl(\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\n(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(x\\in U\\leftrightarrow y\\in U))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land Q=\\{C\\in\\mathcal P(X):\\exists x\\in X\\;C=\\{y\\in X:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\}\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(q,X,Q)\n\\land\\Bigl(\\forall x\\in X\\;q(x)=\\{y\\in X:\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\tau_Q=\\{O\\subseteq Q:q^{-1}[O]\\in\\tau\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"T_0","display":false}],"bytes":1615,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3684","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-topo11-kolmogorov-quotient.md|58-df-zfc-topo11-kolmogorov-quotient]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","74086485fba8d86f","36d7463d215be751"]}